meta {
  name: 01 Quote seats
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/subscription/quote
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "seats": 10
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 201
  res.body.seats: eq 10
  res.body.unitPriceXaf: eq 4500
}

docs {
  What N Start seats would cost. Run `Center Auth / 03 Login` first.

  Body: `{"seats": 10}` — a **total**, not an increment. Launch list price is
  4,500 XAF HT per seat. Quote returns HT (`unitPriceXaf`, `totalXaf` =
  seats × unit). The payment record charges TTC (×1.18) — see `02 Create
  payment` (`amountXaf` 53,100 for ten seats).

  Minimum contract: 10 seats. Below → 400 SEATS_BELOW_MINIMUM.

  THE PRICE IS NOT AN INPUT. Extra fields (`unitPriceXaf`, `amount`, …) → 400
  VALIDATION_ERROR (forbidNonWhitelisted).

  Works while BLOCKED and with an unfinished profile — paying starts with a
  quote. `02 Create payment` still refuses an incomplete profile.
}
